# Learning Rules

## Project manifest

Read **`.arlox/project.json`** at the workspace root for Flutter package name (`stacks.app.package`) and org.

## After adding a feature

1. Pass `flutter analyze`.
2. Consume API contracts from **`contracts/<feature>.md`** (workspace root).
3. Run **`.cursor/skills/learn/SKILL.md`** (mandatory) and append to **`learned/README.md`**.

## Entry format

```markdown
## YYYY-MM-DD — <short title>
**What**: one sentence describing what was done.
**Why**: the reason this approach was chosen over alternatives.
**Gotchas**: anything non-obvious a future agent should know.
```

## Gated learn for `core/`

Before modifying `lib/core/`, read `learned/README.md`. Record rationale for core changes.

## Deferred learnings

Mark risky deferred work with `[PENDING]` in the title. Run **`apply-pending/SKILL.md`** or workspace **`reflect-and-improve/SKILL.md`**.

Mark promoted patterns with `**Applied:** YYYY-MM-DD — <what changed>`.  
Check pending entries with `arlox skills status`.
